hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"317","(54) Jama'at aur Imamat ka bab: Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Malik se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: jama'at ki namaz ki fazilat aadmi ki tanha namaz par pachees darje hai."
"318","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: main ne irada kiya ke main kuch aadmiyon ko hukm dun pas woh namaz qaim karen, phir apne naujawanon ko hukm dun pas woh un logon ki taraf jayen jo us mein hazir nahin hote pas un par un ke ghar lakriyon ke gatthon se jala den, aur agar un mein se koi janta ke woh moti haddi ya do umdah khur payega to Isha mein zaroor hazir hota."
"319","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab tum namaz ki taraf aao to us ke pas daudte hue na aao, aur us ke pas chalte hue aao, aur tum par sakinat lazim hai, pas jo tum pa lo use parh lo, aur jo reh jaye use pura karo."
"320","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab namaz qaim ki jaye... is hi ki manind, aur unhon ne kaha: to pura karo. Aur Shu'aib, Uqayl, Ibn Abi Dhi'b aur ghairon ne is mein kaha: to pura karo."
"321","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Ijli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Muhajirin jab Makkah se Madinah ki taraf aaye to Usbah mein Quba ke pehlu mein utre, to Salim maula Abi Huzaifah ne un ki imamat ki is liye ke woh un mein sab se zyada Quran janne wale thay, un mein Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Asad aur Umar thay."
"322","Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Isma'il ibn Raja se, Aws ibn Dam'aj se, Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: qaum ki imamat woh kare jo un mein Kitabullah ka sab se achcha qari ho, pas agar qirat mein barabar hon to Sunnat ka sab se zyada janne wala, pas agar Sunnat mein barabar hon to hijrat mein sab se aqdam, pas agar hijrat mein barabar hon to umr mein sab se bada. Aur aadmi apne ikhtiyar ki jagah mein imam na bane, aur na us ke ghar mein us ki takrimat par baithe magar us ki ijazat se."
"323","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nu'man ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Amr ibn Salamah Abu Yazid al-Jarmi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum pani ke pas thay jo logon ki guzargah thi, pas hum un se puchte thay ye mamla kya hai, pas unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid hamare aas paas walon ke Islam ke sath gaye, unhon ne kaha: pas woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath jitna Allah ne chaha qiyam pazeer rahe, unhon ne kaha: phir wapis aaye. Jab woh qareeb aaye to hum ne un ka istiqbal kiya, jab hum ne unhen dekha to unhon ne kaha: main tumhare pas Wallah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas se haq ke sath aaya hun. Phir unhon ne kaha: woh tumhen is is cheez ka hukm dete hain aur is is cheez se mana karte hain, aur ke tum is is namaz ko is is waqt mein parho, aur jab namaz hazir ho to tum mein se ek azan de phir tum mein se jo sab se zyada Quran janta ho woh tumhari imamat kare, pas hamare aas paas walon ne dekha to mujh se zyada Quran janne wala koi na paya is wajah se jo main sawaaron se yaad karta tha, unhon ne kaha: pas unhon ne mujhe apne aage kar diya, pas main unhen namaz parhata tha jab ke main chhe sala bacha tha."
"324","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ibn Umm Maktum ko Madinah par do martaba khalifa banaya, aur main ne use Yaum al-Qadisiyyah mein dekha jab ke us ke sath siyah jhanda tha."
"325","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Hazim se (riwayat ki) jinhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi ko kehte hue suna: Ansar ke do muhallon ke darmiyan jahiliyyat ke zamane ki kisi baat par kalah ho gaya hatta ke shaitan ne un ke darmiyan fasad dal diya, aur ek martaba (yun) kaha: hatta ke un me se baaz ne baaz par hath utha liya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khabar di gayi to woh un ke paas aaye phir wahin ruk gaye, to Bilal ne azan di, phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aane me der ho gayi aur woh tashreef na laye to Bilal ne iqamat kah di, to Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aage badhe, phir jab woh aage badh chuke to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef le aaye jabke Abu Bakr logon ki imamat kara rahe the, to Aap saffon me se guzarte hue pehli saff tak pahunche, aur Abu Bakr apni namaz me iltifat nahin karte the, to logon ne is tarah apne hathon se tasfeeh ki, phir jab unhon ne tasfeeh ki awaz suni to mud kar dekha to achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) (maujood) the, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki taraf ishara kiya ke thehre raho, aur ek martaba (yun) kaha: to unhon ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, aur Abu Bakr ulte qadmon peeche hat gaye, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aage badhe, phir jab Aap ne apni namaz poori ki to farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! tumhe qaim rehne se kis cheez ne roka, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhafah ke liye ye (mumkin) na tha ke Allah use apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke aage dekhe."
"326","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ibn Abi Maryam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ya'ni Ibn Ja'far ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Hazim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Sahl ibn Sa'd Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek din mimbar par namaz parhi aur log Aap ke peeche the, to Aap namaz parhne lage, ruku karte, phir sar uthate aur ulte qadmon peeche hatte aur zameen par sajda karte, phir wapas aate aur us par chadh jate, jab bhi sajda karte neeche utarte, phir jab Aap farigh hue to farmaya: Ae logo! maine tumhare (sikhane ke) liye is tarah namaz parhi hai jaisa tum mujhe dekh rahe ho taake tum meri iqtida karo."
